                                "sense_id": "5eee5e21-3e31-32c0-922a-f1f8bd226331",
                                "text": "A man who had thought so much on the subjects of language and education was surely no ordinary preceptor."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1dfe7c7-458c-4e06-8dca-c90bd78f7884",
                                "sense_id": "5eee5e21-3e31-32c0-922a-f1f8bd226331",
                                "text": "We shall resume our studies later on; but just now I am tired of playing the preceptor; and the eager thirst of my pupils for improvement does not console me for the slowness of their progress."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
